  <diagram id="jSr8_F3F5XOm05pVYAqP" name="thanhly">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1892" dy="626" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml AD10_ThanhLyTaiSan\nskinparam defaultFontName \&quot;Arial\&quot;\nskinparam defaultFontSize 11\nskinparam backgroundColor white\nskinparam handwritten false\n\nskinparam activity {\n    BackgroundColor #FFFEE0\n    BorderColor #8B0000\n    FontColor black\n    ArrowColor #8B0000\n    DiamondBackgroundColor #FFFEE0\n    DiamondBorderColor #8B0000\n    DiamondFontColor black\n}\nskinparam note {\n    BackgroundColor white\n    BorderColor #8B0000\n    FontColor black\n    FontSize 10\n}\n\ntitle Hình: Biểu đồ hoạt động của chức năng Thanh lý tài sản\n\n(*) --&gt; \&quot;Chon danh sach tai san cho thanh ly\&quot; as Step1\n--&gt; \&quot;Nhap phuong thuc thanh ly, gia tri thu hoi, ly do thanh ly\&quot;\n--&gt; \&quot;Nhan \\\&quot;Phe duyet thanh ly\\\&quot;\&quot;\n\nif \&quot;\&quot; then\n    -&gt;[hop le] \&quot;Kiem tra trang thai cua cac tai san thanh ly\&quot;\n    if \&quot;\&quot; then\n        -&gt;[tat ca o trang thai Cho thanh ly] \&quot;Kiem tra tham quyen phe duyet cua nguoi dung\&quot;\n        if \&quot;\&quot; then\n            -&gt;[la lanh dao / quan ly] \&quot;Tao phieu thanh ly (TrangThai = Da thanh ly)\&quot;\n            --&gt; \&quot;Luu chi tiet thanh ly (nguyenGia, giaTriConLai, giaTriThuHoi)\&quot;\n            note right: Luu ho so thanh ly va loai bo\\ntai san khoi danh muc trong 1 transaction\n            --&gt; \&quot;Cap nhat trang thai tai san = Da thanh ly\&quot;\n            --&gt; \&quot;Khoa tai san (ngung tinh khau hao, loai khoi su dung)\&quot;\n            --&gt; \&quot;Thong bao thanh ly tai san thanh cong\&quot;\n            --&gt; (*)\n        else\n            -&gt;[khong co quyen phe duyet] \&quot;Huy giao dich (rollback),\\nthong bao nguyen nhan tu choi\&quot; as ErrorNode\n        endif\n    else\n        -&gt;[co tai san khong o trang thai Cho thanh ly] ErrorNode\n    endif\nelse\n    -&gt;[thieu phuong thuc / thieu ly do] ErrorNode\nendif\n\nErrorNode -up-&gt;[Nhap lai] Step1\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="2xi-3M8B8jA2hVfcFwQr-1">
          <mxCell style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;fontSize=15;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="1">
